# "Soul Brother" — Boom Bap
bpm 92
swing 45
steps 32
reverb 0.25
delay 0.15

kick  "x......ox..x.....x......ox..x...."
snare "....x.......x.......x.......x..."
hh    "x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x."
oh    "..............x...............x."
rim   "..x...........x...x...........x."

vol kick 0.85
vol snare 0.75
vol hh 0.5
vol rim 0.35
pan hh -0.15
sendverb snare 0.2

note "C2 C2 ~ ~ Eb2 Eb2 ~ ~ F2 ~ G2 ~ Ab2 ~ ~ ~ C2 C2 ~ ~ Eb2 Eb2 ~ ~ F2 ~ G2 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"
